--- PUSH_NOTIFICATIONS ---
Works in: Play TWA, Android Chrome, desktop browsers (no install needed), iOS home-screen app only.
Tokens: members.fcm_tokens[] (user) / fcm_tokens_admin[] (admin PWA). Legacy fcm_token / fcm_token_admin still written (last device) and read by Functions.
Play Store TWA NOT released yet: lib/appConfig.ts PLAY_STORE_RELEASED=false hides all Play steering. Flip to true after release, then build+deploy.
NEVER auto-request permission. Only from user click: PushPermissionPrompt, AnniversaryView toggle, MyMenu toggle.
useFCMToken: sync token only if permission granted. useForegroundPush: onMessage -> showNotification + toast.
Functions: pushToMember(ref,data,scope,msgs) -> sendEach, removes dead tokens, writes push_last_ok_at/fail_at/error.
Server test: push_tests doc -> onPushTestCreated writes {done,ok,fail,tokens}.
Logout does NOT remove tokens (idle auto-logout would kill anniversary push).
sendAnniversaryReminders runs every minute, sends when KST hour:minute == sendHourKST:sendMinuteKST (default 08:00).
Anniversary push shows receiver-relative relation ("사촌형 홍길동"): functions/scripts/syncShared.js copies client/src/utils/relationLabel.ts into functions/src/shared/ on every functions build. Edit the client file only.
Admin can change all settings via AdminView -> settings/push doc. No redeploy.
login_logs purged monthly (1yr retention) by cleanupLoginLogs function.

